age 1","sha256":"7953ee75c44ad9c9a2748d3edea7c5ab1d0fa95eb79fdd496a27397d209f7ed1","name":"BANK Page 1","originalSheet":null,"kind":"bank","moneyColumns":[]},{"source":"04 Bank/Cobalt Harbor Bank Statement x4417 - October 2026.pdf","locator":"Page 2","sha256":"7953ee75c44ad9c9a2748d3edea7c5ab1d0fa95eb79fdd496a27397d209f7ed1","name":"BANK Page 2","originalSheet":null,"kind":"bank","moneyColumns":[]},{"source":"02 HR/Union Wage and Fringe Schedule - June 1, 2026.pdf","locator":"Page 1","sha256":"ef204c65d3f428b3854291abbc616497d566aab94a25ee26d93002567e932e6f","name":"WAGE Page 1","originalSheet":null,"kind":"wages","moneyColumns":[]},{"source":"02 HR/Income Withholding Order E-115.pdf","locator":"Page 1","sha256":"5b52458da3ed6e00e9231a73bd8eaa29b88ae66f5ef2d7e416dd058d6d5cfc00","name":"IWO Page 1","originalSheet":null,"kind":"order","moneyColumns":[]},{"source":"02 HR/Separation Notice E-124 - October 9.pdf","locator":"Page 1","sha256":"128886b3e433adc2fc951c5bb8b6c56427a76f9076f1746928a69ee26539cf91","name":"SEP Page 1","originalSheet":null,"kind":"separation","moneyColumns":[]},{"source":"06 Procedures/HANGS Payroll Procedures v1.2.docx","locator":"Clauses PAY-1 to PAY-6; Appendix A, accounts used for payroll","sha256":"f788e59cca4858600ec013fb0f6c772e0ea5c9cdaa115e6fa608755507da7f80","name":"E16 Payroll Procedures","originalSheet":null,"kind":"policy","moneyColumns":[]}],"openItems":[{"id":"Garnishment Not Remitted · PAY-5","status":"open","amount":"312.50","explanation":"$312.50 withheld from E-115 on October 24 under order WA-DEMO-000417 was never sent to the State Support Registry. The order requires $312.50 each pay period, remitted within 7 business days. The October 24 register withheld it, Brookline's funding took it from the bank, and GL 2145 was cleared as if it had been paid. Brookline's remittance report says otherwise: \"Not remitted: payee remittance ID missing in Brookline\". The October 10 payment went out on time. This one was due November 3 and is past due. AJ-01 puts the obligation back in 2145 Garnishments Payable and the money Brookline holds in 1280. Have Brookline add the remittance ID and pay it today, and keep the proof of payment with the order."},{"id":"Terminated Employee Still Paid · PAY-2","status":"open","amount":"2597.13","explanation":"E-124 left on October 9 but was paid 80 hours, $2,250.00 gross, on October 24. The separation notice gives October 9 as the last day worked, with final pay on the October 10 payroll, and HR shows the employee as terminated. Brookline still shows the employee as active, so the salary ran again for October 10 to October 23, 2026, a period that starts after the last day. Net pay of $1,784.97 was deposited. The cost to HANGS is $2,597.13: $2,250.00 of wages, $172.13 of employer social security and Medicare and $175.00 of benefits. AJ-02 moves it from 6000 Salaries & Wages to 1260 Payroll Overpayment Receivable. Recover the net pay from the former employee, have Brookline process a wage correction so the taxes come back on the fourth-quarter return, and end-date the employee. The close's RJ-05 accrual was computed from this register and carries $1,298.57 of this person's cost (5 of 10 workdays); reduce it by that amount."},{"id":"Overtime Paid at Straight Time · PAY-3","status":"open","amount":"115.50","explanation":"E-108 worked 6 overtime hours paid at $38.50; the schedule requires $57.75. The union schedule pays 1.5 times the straight-time rate over 40 hours a week. E-108 is a carpenter at $38.50, so overtime is $57.75 an hour; the October 24 register paid $38.50. 6 hours short by $19.25 is $115.50 owed to the employee, plus $8.83 of employer social security and Medicare. Of 14 overtime lines in October, this is the only one paid at the wrong rate. AJ-03 accrues the cost to job 27-05; pay it on the November 7 payroll and fix the overtime rate on this employee's record in Brookline."}],"incomplete":true,"research":null}